            "title": "Over  a Decade of \nCurating Culture\n",
            "subtitle": "Creative Events Australia is a premier event management company based in Melbourne, known for bringing the biggest Punjabi and Bollywood artists to Australia and New Zealand. For over a decade, we’ve organized high-profile concerts, family shows, community events, and gala dinners that unite people across cultures.",
